# Skills Taxonomy

All shared skills live under `.cursor/skills/`, grouped by purpose. When looking
for or adding a skill, use the right category folder:

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `.cursor/skills/sprout-skills/` | Skills for creating new **sprouts** (early-stage ideas) before they graduate into limbs. |
| `.cursor/skills/build-skills/` | Skills for building and coding, plus limb lifecycle and per-app skills. Some are copy-on-demand into a limb (e.g. `upload-to-testflight`, `sentry-healthcheck`); copy in only what a limb needs. |
| `.cursor/skills/marketing-skills/` | Marketing skills. Contains subfolders (e.g. `aso-skills/`). |
| `.cursor/skills/revenue-skills/` | Skills related to revenue reporting. |

## Notes

- A limb's own skills live under `limbs/<limb-name>/.cursor/skills/`. The
  copy-on-demand skills in `build-skills/` are the source set that gets
  transferred there.
- Each skill is a directory containing a `SKILL.md`; some include
  `references/`, `tools/`, or `README.md`.
